<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS</p>
<p>Panagia - (built 1996) 84,750 dwt sold to Norwegian buyers for $31 million.</p>
<p>Pagoda - (built 1988) 29,996 dwt sold to Belgian buyers for $20 million.</p>
<p>Herdis - (built 1978) 28,400 dwt sold to Indian buyers for $24 million.</p>
<p>Neptra Progress - (built 1984) 7,554 dwt sold to Korean buyers for $6.7 million.  </p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they maybe subject to inspection, survey or other conditions before completion.</p>
</text>
